{"sha":"31289f45984e4f9de29e25a4463d0936976e8b5d","node_id":"C_kwDOIZiOrNoAKDMxMjg5ZjQ1OTg0ZTRmOWRlMjllMjVhNDQ2M2QwOTM2OTc2ZThiNWQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Ryan Newton","email":"rrnewton@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-17T09:21:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"Ryan Newton","email":"ryan.newton@alum.mit.edu","date":"2026-09-17T09:33:46Z"},"message":"Pin retained frozen validation support\n\n[hermit2, degraded-unresolved, gpt-6-astra, devbig014, role=impl]\n\nPlain Language Summary and Project Impact\n\nAdvance Agent Utils so an authenticated incomplete frozen validation stays on disk while unrelated validation can start. The retained no-result gains neither removal authority nor a successful result. This makes the provider available for the parent cleanup change already landed at 55d1426b1614419df3fe623a3d1aab8d1724f724.\n\nTask: kvm-lane-to-full-determinism-and-parity\n\nThe gitlink advances from 2781b1054efc3a9c561dbed35584a6fca1ed8676 to d750224cbf10c5a3b35eec40fa4d57d0e98493cb through ten linear commits: eight earlier Agent Utils main commits, followed by the incomplete-validation retention implementation and its exact lifecycle-inventory update. The earlier commits correct ordinary slot owner and cgroup decisions, deduplicate audit output, and add Herdr worker, goal and Chat management with matching packaging.\n\nDeterminism\n\nThis advances validation infrastructure. Hermit scheduling, guest observations, comparisons, test selection and resource limits retain the same source. An incomplete validation remains a no-result.\n\nLinux Semantics\n\nThe earlier ordinary-slot changes narrow ownership and cgroup blockers under the owner’s policy. Existing frozen-validation removal checks remain required, and this pin changes no Hermit guest semantics.\n\nValidation\n\nAgent Utils with-proxy make validate passed at d750224cbf10c5a3b35eec40fa4d57d0e98493cb in 2064.235 seconds: 3,765 Python tests, the Rust workspace suite, 1,537 cross checks, seven Python distribution checks and four Rust crate checks. Existing cross-check coverage limitations remain recorded in the complete output. Fresh remote fetch and content readback match all 828 published Agent Utils tree entries. The old pin is an ancestor through the ten recorded commits. Hermit service-result schema and producer bytes match the reviewed 98d checkout. This dependency evidence does not claim a new Hermit full-DAG or KVM CLI result; post-commit submodule verification is recorded separately.","tree":{"sha":"f8c5362a6b21bc48188acb595043382e1307877e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/git/trees/f8c5362a6b21bc48188acb595043382e1307877e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/git/commits/31289f45984e4f9de29e25a4463d0936976e8b5d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/commits/31289f45984e4f9de29e25a4463d0936976e8b5d","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/commit/31289f45984e4f9de29e25a4463d0936976e8b5d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/commits/31289f45984e4f9de29e25a4463d0936976e8b5d/comments","author":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_